WEBVTT

00:13.013 --> 00:14.764
JINWON HIGH SCHOOL

01:09.944 --> 01:11.362
Ms. Choi

01:12.155 --> 01:15.366
was the only good adult I knew.

01:15.909 --> 01:18.119
Everyone gave up on me,

01:18.203 --> 01:21.331
but Ms. Choi did not.

01:23.625 --> 01:24.667
I was…

01:26.795 --> 01:29.547
in love with Ms. Choi.

01:50.777 --> 01:52.278
-You're here.
-Yeah.

01:55.448 --> 01:57.492
Why is it so dark in here?

01:57.575 --> 01:59.285
-Here.
-Thank you.

01:59.369 --> 02:01.996
The more alone you are,
the brighter your space should be.

02:02.705 --> 02:04.958
I made too much geotjeori.

02:05.041 --> 02:07.544
You don't like it fermented.
Put it in your fridge.

02:08.711 --> 02:10.922
Do you expect me to eat all of this?

02:20.431 --> 02:22.183
Gosh, this is…

02:22.267 --> 02:23.143
What?

02:25.186 --> 02:26.187
It's tied tightly.

02:26.771 --> 02:27.772
So it wouldn't leak.

02:28.731 --> 02:29.566
It won't.

02:40.034 --> 02:41.619
Would you like a cup of tea?

02:48.960 --> 02:49.878
Sir.

03:00.972 --> 03:03.099
If an action carries emotion…

03:06.895 --> 03:08.521
that's when it becomes violence.

03:10.064 --> 03:11.733
Don't make me tell you

03:11.816 --> 03:14.152
to forget my daughter.

03:15.528 --> 03:16.446
Yes, sir.

03:18.448 --> 03:19.908
I haven't eaten yet.

03:20.575 --> 03:22.118
Let's have the geotjeori.

03:25.288 --> 03:26.831
Is instant rice okay?

03:26.915 --> 03:30.585
Do you really want to give
your father-in-law instant rice?

03:30.668 --> 03:33.171
But you made me instant rice
last time too.

03:34.214 --> 03:36.007
Cook some rice so it scorches.

03:40.178 --> 03:41.012
You punk…

03:41.095 --> 03:43.514
-I'll go buy some rice.
-Don't you have any rice?

03:43.598 --> 03:47.769
If you want scorched rice,
I have some instant scorched rice.

03:49.020 --> 03:51.105
No, I mean…

03:51.189 --> 03:54.525
-I can make it from instant rice.
-I just want freshly cooked rice.

03:54.609 --> 03:56.819
-Well…
-I eat instant rice every day.

03:56.903 --> 04:00.865
The ERPB's approval ratings
have topped 50% for the first time.

04:00.949 --> 04:03.201
In a survey
of potential presidential candidates,

04:03.284 --> 04:07.789
Minister Choi Gang-seok's approval rating
has surged compared to the previous poll.

04:07.872 --> 04:11.709
Some believe he has hit the nail
on the head about the public's concerns.

04:11.793 --> 04:13.294
That's right.

04:13.378 --> 04:17.507
The ERPB has yet to shake the label of
"a group that acts on personal vendettas."

04:17.590 --> 04:21.344
Since the ERPB's key members
are the deceased female teacher's family,

04:21.427 --> 04:22.929
it is likely that…

04:28.017 --> 04:30.061
This is going to be yummy.

04:34.774 --> 04:36.693
Don't you have hot water at home?

04:36.776 --> 04:39.737
I can't be bothered.
It'll be ready by the time I get home.

04:40.488 --> 04:42.365
That's why I said I'd buy you dinner.

04:42.448 --> 04:44.951
Having a meal with your boss
feels like work.

04:45.034 --> 04:45.994
Oh yeah?

04:47.203 --> 04:48.288
Just talking to myself.

04:48.371 --> 04:51.541
Jesus, is it still talking to yourself
if I can hear everything you say?

04:52.917 --> 04:56.462
Do you think
I could just go home from here?

04:56.546 --> 04:59.215
Why? I'll give you a ride.
Do you have plans or something?

04:59.299 --> 05:04.220
I feel like something always happens
when I'm with you two,

05:04.304 --> 05:05.596
and I always get home late.

05:05.680 --> 05:06.681
Hold on.

05:07.307 --> 05:08.141
What's going on?

05:10.560 --> 05:12.478
Looks like they're trying to steal a car.

05:14.397 --> 05:16.190
-I'll call the police.
-No, don't.

05:16.274 --> 05:18.818
They're wearing school uniforms.
This is our job.

05:20.069 --> 05:22.363
Hold this for a second. Here you go.

05:24.866 --> 05:26.617
Then what should I do?

05:27.118 --> 05:27.952
Stand by.

05:29.162 --> 05:31.080
But the instant noodles…

05:31.164 --> 05:34.083
I was going to go home
and clean my graphics card…

05:34.167 --> 05:35.585
-Snap out of it.
-Oh man.

05:37.545 --> 05:38.963
You shouldn't have had so much.

05:39.464 --> 05:40.965
What's gotten into you?

05:49.057 --> 05:52.185
Nice! This is fucking sweet.

05:52.268 --> 05:53.686
Here we go.

05:53.770 --> 05:54.687
Fuck, whatever.

05:54.771 --> 05:55.980
-Stop.
-Shit.

05:56.064 --> 05:57.815
-Stop.
-Who's that?

05:57.899 --> 05:59.192
Hey, get out.

05:59.275 --> 06:00.693
Get out of the way! Move!

06:02.028 --> 06:03.613
-Whoa, what the…
-What is this?

06:03.696 --> 06:05.740
Squirtle's Water Gun?
The Waterbomb festival?

06:05.823 --> 06:07.450
-Move!
-I said get out.

06:07.533 --> 06:09.911
I'm moving now. Whoa, shit.

06:09.994 --> 06:10.828
-I'm going.
-Stop.

06:10.912 --> 06:12.038
I'm going now.

06:12.121 --> 06:14.707
I said I'm moving now.
I don't care. Damn it!

06:14.791 --> 06:15.875
-Move!
-Hey.

06:15.958 --> 06:16.876
I can't see!

06:16.959 --> 06:18.336
-What the hell?
-Stop!

06:18.419 --> 06:20.380
Is he Spider-Man or what?

06:20.463 --> 06:22.757
-Get ahold of yourself. Damn it.
-Hey.

06:24.717 --> 06:25.551
Yes?

06:25.635 --> 06:27.887
I'm an ERPB inspector.

06:27.970 --> 06:29.639
What are you doing with that girl?

06:31.641 --> 06:33.309
Wow, the ERPB. Holy shit.

06:41.818 --> 06:43.111
Move!

06:46.322 --> 06:47.657
Inspector, are you okay?

06:48.408 --> 06:49.867
Those damn punks.

06:50.660 --> 06:51.911
Damn it. Move!

06:55.998 --> 06:56.833
That was crazy!

07:04.340 --> 07:05.341
Those bastards.

07:10.388 --> 07:11.264
Im Han-rim, run!

07:13.307 --> 07:14.142
What about me?

07:16.978 --> 07:18.312
For God's sake!

07:20.898 --> 07:21.983
Seriously!

07:22.066 --> 07:23.359
Hey, hold on tight!

07:30.741 --> 07:31.742
It's hot!

07:33.453 --> 07:34.745
-He's damn good.
-Passed one.

07:34.829 --> 07:36.831
How am I this good at driving?

07:38.583 --> 07:40.042
-Fucking passed another!
-Fuck.

07:40.126 --> 07:41.002
Hold on tight!

07:48.426 --> 07:51.012
-What the hell?
-Isn't that guy dead yet?

07:51.095 --> 07:52.263
Set them off!

07:52.346 --> 07:53.556
Hey!

07:54.390 --> 07:55.349
Stop the car.

07:59.479 --> 08:01.147
Set them all off!

08:01.230 --> 08:02.523
Fuck, it's hot!

08:15.828 --> 08:17.330
I can't believe this.

08:27.173 --> 08:28.633
Today is epic.

08:28.716 --> 08:29.759
I got them!

08:31.302 --> 08:32.970
Yes, fire!

08:33.054 --> 08:35.556
Those punks. Seriously.

08:51.989 --> 08:53.199
Go!

08:53.282 --> 08:55.076
Bang!

08:58.037 --> 09:00.206
Who cares?!

09:00.289 --> 09:01.666
Is he still fucking behind us?

09:01.749 --> 09:03.292
Shit, what do we do?

09:05.586 --> 09:07.338
-What the hell?
-Those little…

09:09.173 --> 09:10.424
Step on it!

09:18.474 --> 09:20.810
This is crazy! Your driving is sick!

09:24.939 --> 09:28.609
-Why are you still holding that?
-She said she was hungry.

09:35.700 --> 09:37.076
Hey, it's splashing me!

09:40.121 --> 09:40.955
Hey!

09:41.581 --> 09:43.457
-Hey! Pull over!
-Careful.

09:43.541 --> 09:45.042
-What?
-I'm not gonna.

09:45.126 --> 09:46.419
Yeah, no. Not pulling over.

09:46.502 --> 09:47.962
I won't. Why would I?

09:48.045 --> 09:49.797
-Get lost.
-Hey, you punk!

09:49.880 --> 09:51.007
He just flipped me off.

09:52.216 --> 09:53.718
-Be careful.
-Damn it.

09:53.801 --> 09:54.969
Passed you, didn't I?

09:58.723 --> 09:59.640
Move!

10:01.976 --> 10:03.436
Whatever, I'm going for it.

10:09.483 --> 10:10.401
What are you doing?

10:13.487 --> 10:15.156
-Those crazy bastards!
-Are you nuts?

10:18.284 --> 10:19.368
Hands off the wheel!

10:25.750 --> 10:26.917
Who are you guys?

10:32.089 --> 10:33.257
We're juvenile offenders.

10:34.050 --> 10:36.260
-What?
-We're 14 years old.

10:38.804 --> 10:39.722
Right.

10:43.059 --> 10:44.268
The police are here.

10:45.853 --> 10:48.397
INCHEON GANGHWA POLICE STATION

10:48.481 --> 10:49.857
We were going this way.

10:49.940 --> 10:51.442
Inspector Im Han-rim was…

10:51.525 --> 10:54.654
-Hey, there. Wake up. Are you okay?
-Inspector Im was…

10:54.737 --> 10:58.324
She threw a bike under the car

10:58.407 --> 11:00.159
and stopped it.

11:00.242 --> 11:01.243
Are you all right?

11:01.327 --> 11:03.120
She stopped them from fleeing.

11:05.915 --> 11:07.083
Pull yourself together.

11:08.459 --> 11:10.002
Yun-jin's just drunk.

11:10.086 --> 11:11.504
She had three bottles.

11:11.587 --> 11:13.214
-She drank loads.
-She had more.

11:13.297 --> 11:14.131
She had a lot.

11:15.424 --> 11:18.386
They think we were trying to do
something to her.

11:18.469 --> 11:20.012
We're really all friends.

11:20.096 --> 11:21.472
-That's right.
-Totally.

11:24.266 --> 11:25.601
Are you really friends?

11:26.560 --> 11:28.229
Yes, we are.

11:29.188 --> 11:31.190
So just leave us alone.

11:31.273 --> 11:32.608
See? I told you.

11:32.692 --> 11:34.860
She said we're friends.
We're total besties.

11:34.944 --> 11:36.195
-Exactly.
-Be quiet, punk!

11:36.278 --> 11:38.364
You've committed car theft,
unlicensed driving,

11:38.447 --> 11:39.699
and traffic violations!

11:39.782 --> 11:42.118
-I'm sorry, sir.
-I'm sorry, sir.

11:42.201 --> 11:45.705
But the engine was running,
and we just got in out of curiosity.

11:45.788 --> 11:47.540
That's right. It's our hormones.

11:47.623 --> 11:49.875
We're impulsive.
It's what happens at our age.

11:49.959 --> 11:50.960
-It's our age.
-Yeah.

11:51.043 --> 11:55.005
We're juvenile offenders for a reason.
We're really sorry.

11:55.506 --> 11:56.632
We're sorry.

11:56.716 --> 11:58.259
-We're sorry!
-We're sorry!

11:58.342 --> 12:01.095
-Is that how you show you're sorry?
-We're sorry!

12:01.178 --> 12:02.847
Im Han-rim, don't.

12:04.265 --> 12:06.642
They know they won't be punished.

12:06.726 --> 12:07.768
That's correct.

12:07.852 --> 12:10.187
They've been here multiple times already.

12:10.271 --> 12:13.941
They know the police can't touch them,
as long as they play stupid,

12:14.024 --> 12:15.776
because they're underage.

12:15.860 --> 12:17.611
They know the law too well. Sit still.

12:18.738 --> 12:22.450
-Did you call the parents?
-Yes, but they'll be a while.

12:22.533 --> 12:24.618
Our homeroom teacher said
he'd come right away.

12:25.286 --> 12:27.037
-Hand them over when he arrives.
-Okay.

12:27.538 --> 12:28.873
-Chief.
-Yes?

12:30.583 --> 12:32.042
What happens now?

12:32.126 --> 12:35.671
Serious cases go to juvenile court
and protective dispositions issued.

12:35.755 --> 12:38.466
But for a case like this,
we let them off with a warning.

12:39.759 --> 12:42.887
I heard there's nothing
the school can do either.

12:45.014 --> 12:45.848
Here he comes.

12:46.432 --> 12:48.976
-You can hear from him directly.
-Hello, Mr. Lee.

12:51.479 --> 12:53.564
CUSTODY HANDOVER CONFIRMATION FORM

13:05.034 --> 13:06.452
We'll be on our way now.

13:06.535 --> 13:09.789
Come and see me first thing tomorrow.
We'll talk more then.

13:09.872 --> 13:10.706
-Okay.
-Thank you.

13:10.790 --> 13:11.707
We appreciate you.

13:11.791 --> 13:12.833
-Thank you.
-Thank you.

13:15.628 --> 13:16.712
-Goodbye.
-Thank you.

13:16.796 --> 13:17.713
Get her home safe.

13:17.797 --> 13:19.006
-Goodbye, sir.
-Take care.

13:23.177 --> 13:24.303
It's unsettling, right?

13:24.887 --> 13:27.056
Even I can't get used to
the way they speak.

13:27.139 --> 13:29.058
I hear you're from the ERPB?

13:29.141 --> 13:29.975
Yes.

13:30.476 --> 13:31.727
I'm Inspector Na Hwa-jin.

13:33.395 --> 13:34.396
Excuse me.

13:35.523 --> 13:38.776
I'm afraid you two will have to write
another statement.

13:38.859 --> 13:40.861
Those punks reported you both.

13:41.695 --> 13:42.530
For what?

13:42.613 --> 13:43.781
For child abuse.

13:43.864 --> 13:46.867
You can report it
through the app these days, so…

13:47.576 --> 13:48.536
Damn it.

13:50.538 --> 13:53.833
I'm sorry.
I should have taught them better.

13:53.916 --> 13:56.252
Not at all. It's not for you to apologize.

13:56.335 --> 13:58.504
It's embarrassing
to say this as a teacher,

13:59.004 --> 14:01.090
but the school is a mess because of them.

14:01.173 --> 14:05.553
They know all too well
that adults can't do anything to them.

14:07.847 --> 14:09.640
What about the school rules?

14:09.723 --> 14:13.102
They say they're juvenile offenders.
Do you think rules will work on them?

14:13.185 --> 14:14.770
It'll be hard to expel them too

14:14.854 --> 14:17.898
because middle school education
is mandatory.

14:20.901 --> 14:21.735
Sir?

14:25.072 --> 14:26.448
Juvenile offenders played you?

14:27.366 --> 14:28.242
Yes, sir.

14:29.034 --> 14:32.454
I did hear that "juvenile offender"
is like a title from the heavens.

14:32.538 --> 14:35.249
I guess former special forces
are no match for them either.

14:36.292 --> 14:38.502
I want to too!

14:41.755 --> 14:42.590
Who are they?

14:43.883 --> 14:46.343
It's them. The invincible 14-year-olds.

14:47.011 --> 14:48.095
Bye.

14:49.972 --> 14:50.890
Shit.

14:54.435 --> 14:56.478
Bye!

14:56.562 --> 14:58.606
This is fun. Yes, fun indeed.

14:58.689 --> 15:00.983
-Did you say Hyeonjin Middle School?
-Yes, sir.

15:01.066 --> 15:02.735
Report to work there from tomorrow.

15:08.824 --> 15:11.577
HYEONJIN MIDDLE SCHOOL

15:14.330 --> 15:16.081
Jung Seung-jin!

15:16.582 --> 15:17.416
-Hey.
-Yeah.

15:17.499 --> 15:19.001
Why don't you say hi these days?

15:21.462 --> 15:22.379
Why the look?

15:22.463 --> 15:24.298
-Did I hit you?
-No.

15:24.381 --> 15:25.716
Yes, I did, you dumbass.

15:25.799 --> 15:27.760
-You're here early.
-Damn it.

15:27.843 --> 15:28.844
Oh, hello.

15:28.928 --> 15:29.762
Hello.

15:30.512 --> 15:31.388
What's your name?

15:32.222 --> 15:33.223
Jung Seung-jin.

15:33.307 --> 15:35.184
Okay, Seung-jin. Get to class.

15:37.227 --> 15:39.063
See you later. Put my bag on my desk.

15:39.563 --> 15:41.148
You guys are so diligent.

15:41.231 --> 15:43.150
You should skip school once in a while

15:43.233 --> 15:46.153
so the other kids can breathe,
don't you think?

15:46.236 --> 15:47.613
The ERPB is different.

15:47.696 --> 15:49.114
They're really here.

15:49.198 --> 15:51.200
You gave us a real gift yesterday.

15:51.283 --> 15:53.786
I'm here to return the favor.
Give and take.

15:53.869 --> 15:55.120
What's give and cake?

15:55.204 --> 15:57.915
We need to carry out
a proper investigation starting now.

15:57.998 --> 15:58.832
Are you free?

15:58.916 --> 15:59.875
-No.
-No.

15:59.959 --> 16:01.085
Why? Are you busy?

16:01.168 --> 16:03.087
No, we're free. It's fine, right?

16:03.587 --> 16:05.756
Okay, get to the counseling room.

16:05.839 --> 16:06.966
To the counseling room.

16:07.049 --> 16:08.676
Nice. We get to skip class.

16:10.844 --> 16:12.429
The ERPB came for us. We made it.

16:12.513 --> 16:14.598
-I'll be famous.
-I don't have a signature.

16:14.682 --> 16:15.849
-I need one.
-This is mad.

16:15.933 --> 16:16.767
What's this?

16:18.018 --> 16:19.561
I told you I'll investigate.

16:19.645 --> 16:22.189
I know.
This is a bluff to buy time, right?

16:22.272 --> 16:23.524
-Busted!
-Busted, right?

16:23.607 --> 16:25.025
They say they'll investigate.

16:25.109 --> 16:28.779
But they're isolating us and are probably
taking the victims' statements.

16:28.862 --> 16:31.532
Well, aren't you Detective Conan?

16:31.615 --> 16:33.117
Then let's confess now.

16:33.200 --> 16:35.452
Go ahead. Do whatever the hell you want.

16:42.793 --> 16:44.378
No one will find out

16:44.461 --> 16:46.255
what is said here.

16:47.047 --> 16:50.551
If Min Ji-ung's crew has ever bullied you
or you've seen them bully others…

16:52.052 --> 16:53.262
No such thing happened.

16:54.513 --> 16:55.514
No.

16:55.597 --> 16:56.765
We're not that close.

16:56.849 --> 16:59.643
I honestly don't know anything,
so please stop asking me.

16:59.727 --> 17:01.937
I'm not sure.

17:02.021 --> 17:03.397
No, nothing like that.

17:12.990 --> 17:13.949
Well…

17:14.450 --> 17:17.453
Apparently, the student
you asked me to investigate

17:17.536 --> 17:20.998
does hang around Min Ji-ung,

17:21.498 --> 17:24.043
but they're not exactly friends.

17:24.626 --> 17:25.753
What are they, then?

17:25.836 --> 17:28.255
She wouldn't tell me
anything more than that.

17:30.132 --> 17:32.134
And where is Yun-jin?

17:32.217 --> 17:34.470
She's here today,
but she wasn't at her desk.

17:37.890 --> 17:40.726
-Where is this?
-The recycling area behind this building.

17:41.310 --> 17:43.687
I don't think this is it.
Let's look elsewhere.

17:43.771 --> 17:46.732
The sly jerks move in packs
and make their hideouts

17:46.815 --> 17:49.526
far enough away from the buildings

17:49.610 --> 17:54.948
where cleaners or maintenance workers go.
They're easier to handle than teachers.

17:56.825 --> 18:00.120
Given those variables
and conditional value…

18:01.789 --> 18:03.749
-What about here?
-Where is this?

18:03.832 --> 18:06.418
There's a standalone building
right beside this gym.

18:16.345 --> 18:18.013
I think this is the place.

18:18.847 --> 18:19.848
Look at this.

18:24.520 --> 18:25.646
Come this way. This way!

18:36.657 --> 18:38.784
There should be a key
somewhere around here.

18:38.867 --> 18:40.119
Are you in there?

18:42.913 --> 18:44.039
We don't need it.

18:46.041 --> 18:48.335
Whoa! What are you doing?

19:10.149 --> 19:11.900
NURSE'S OFFICE

19:22.411 --> 19:24.121
Here. I'll take that.

19:29.710 --> 19:31.753
Can I ask why you were in there?

19:34.840 --> 19:36.550
Was it Min Ji-ung?

19:39.303 --> 19:40.888
Why were you with them yesterday?

19:41.930 --> 19:43.265
I told you we drank together.

19:43.348 --> 19:45.100
Then why didn't you smell of alcohol?

19:47.060 --> 19:50.105
And why, if you hadn't been drinking,

19:51.773 --> 19:53.233
did you seem drunk?

19:58.947 --> 20:00.282
Can I look inside that bag?

20:01.658 --> 20:02.701
What? No.

20:03.577 --> 20:04.912
Gosh, be gentle.

20:12.544 --> 20:13.712
What's this? Medicine?

20:15.005 --> 20:16.089
They're supplements.

20:17.049 --> 20:18.175
Is that so?

20:19.009 --> 20:20.969
Then I'll have one too.

20:21.053 --> 20:23.639
I've been working late a lot
and need to recharge.

20:23.722 --> 20:25.057
You can't take that!

20:27.768 --> 20:29.269
If I shouldn't take it,

20:29.353 --> 20:31.813
you shouldn't either, should you?

20:36.318 --> 20:38.403
Was it these drugs yesterday too?

20:40.948 --> 20:42.783
Was it because of these drugs?

20:51.208 --> 20:52.334
Oh Yun!

20:55.295 --> 20:57.589
You look quite pretty today.

20:58.173 --> 20:59.883
Is it eye shadow? Or blush?

20:59.967 --> 21:01.260
Blush. Can you tell?

21:01.343 --> 21:02.427
Yes, totally.

21:02.511 --> 21:04.179
-You look so trendy.
-Totally agreed.

21:04.680 --> 21:05.931
Just lose a little weight.

21:06.598 --> 21:08.016
I'm already a lost cause.

21:08.100 --> 21:10.519
But if you slim down a bit,
you'll be Jang Won-young.

21:10.602 --> 21:14.231
Maybe I'm going to grow.
I've been craving food like crazy.

21:14.731 --> 21:16.858
It did seem like it
when I watched your Shorts.

21:16.942 --> 21:18.068
Did it really?

21:18.568 --> 21:20.487
Your dancing seemed a little sluggish.

21:21.738 --> 21:23.073
In that case,

21:23.156 --> 21:25.826
my diet starts again, starting today.

21:25.909 --> 21:27.953
You've said that 300 times.

21:28.036 --> 21:29.621
Man, you're pissing me off.

21:29.705 --> 21:31.290
TTEOKBOKKI
MALATANG LEVEL 2

21:31.373 --> 21:32.958
CHEWY COOKIES
DUBAI CHOCOLATE

21:38.046 --> 21:40.674
Aren't you having lunch?
Can't you afford it?

21:40.757 --> 21:42.926
No, I'm just trying to lose weight.

21:43.510 --> 21:44.803
You'd be pretty if you did.

21:45.387 --> 21:46.346
Do you think so too?

21:46.430 --> 21:49.308
But you still need to eat something.
Starving won't help.

21:51.184 --> 21:52.019
Hey.

21:54.479 --> 21:55.397
Wanna try these?

21:56.106 --> 21:57.566
Someone lost 20 kg with these.

21:57.649 --> 21:59.484
I secretly swiped a few.

22:00.110 --> 22:01.903
They went from 57 kg to 37 kg.

22:02.404 --> 22:05.240
Apparently, K-pop stars are taking them.
They can't be bad.

22:05.741 --> 22:07.951
Take one,
and you'll feel the fucking difference.

22:08.035 --> 22:10.162
Look, it's a heart.

22:10.996 --> 22:12.122
Aren't they cute?

22:14.958 --> 22:15.792
Watch this.

22:17.627 --> 22:18.837
Put it in here.

22:25.010 --> 22:26.636
Just treat me if you lose weight.

22:31.391 --> 22:33.226
-Don't drink it, then.
-I will.

22:40.734 --> 22:43.945
TYPICAL DANCE SKILLS
OF A MIDDLE SCHOOL GIRL

22:47.240 --> 22:48.283
Yun-jin.

22:49.576 --> 22:51.620
You look damn pretty in your Shorts video.

22:51.703 --> 22:53.330
Is it because you've lost weight?

22:53.914 --> 22:54.790
Do I look it?

22:54.873 --> 22:56.875
The pills are working wonders.
Want another?

22:59.669 --> 23:00.629
Do you have more?

23:01.296 --> 23:02.381
Of course.

23:05.175 --> 23:06.009
Heart.

23:07.969 --> 23:10.555
Is there any chance
you can get more of those pills?

23:10.639 --> 23:13.934
I can get more.
Not for free though. I need money for it.

23:14.017 --> 23:15.102
How much?

23:16.019 --> 23:18.105
-How much is it?
-About 30,000 won?

23:31.785 --> 23:33.036
It's 50,000 won.

23:34.996 --> 23:35.831
What?

23:43.255 --> 23:45.340
Damn nice!

23:45.841 --> 23:47.592
-Fuck.
-Hey.

23:48.218 --> 23:50.220
Could you get me some pills?

23:51.847 --> 23:54.307
But I don't have any money right now.

23:54.391 --> 23:55.934
Fuck! Street-begging bitch.

23:57.018 --> 23:57.853
Sorry?

23:58.979 --> 24:01.314
It's a joke. I was joking. You scared?

24:01.898 --> 24:02.732
Scared?

24:03.900 --> 24:04.734
Well…

24:05.235 --> 24:06.778
If you don't have money…

24:08.780 --> 24:10.198
you could just work for it.

24:18.915 --> 24:20.000
Is delivering hard?

24:21.126 --> 24:22.711
Is your head just for decoration?

24:25.172 --> 24:27.674
You just give them the pills
and take the money.

24:27.757 --> 24:31.094
You know?
Give and take, you fucking bitch!

24:31.178 --> 24:32.804
What's wrong with you all?

24:32.888 --> 24:34.347
Shit! I could just…

24:36.766 --> 24:37.601
Oh Yun-jin!

24:38.185 --> 24:41.438
I trust that you won't disappoint us.
Hand over the money.

24:43.106 --> 24:43.940
Gosh.

24:48.403 --> 24:49.404
Nice.

24:53.533 --> 24:54.367
Up it 20,000.

24:55.327 --> 24:56.161
20,000 won?

24:58.413 --> 24:59.414
What if no one buys?

25:00.457 --> 25:02.292
You've got a goldfish brain?

25:03.043 --> 25:06.129
You bought it
even after the price went up, so raise it.

25:07.547 --> 25:08.423
Say something.

25:10.759 --> 25:12.093
Well…

25:13.428 --> 25:15.096
Could I stop doing this now?

25:16.181 --> 25:18.350
It's been really tough for me,
and I'm scared.

25:20.101 --> 25:21.645
Fuck! Damn it!

25:24.564 --> 25:25.690
Give me the pills.

25:25.774 --> 25:27.734
-What?
-Give it here.

25:28.318 --> 25:31.738
I guess you don't need
the pills either, do you?

25:37.827 --> 25:39.120
Holy shit.

25:39.204 --> 25:40.997
That's 50,000 won gone.

25:46.002 --> 25:46.836
What now?

25:47.337 --> 25:48.421
Want another chance?

25:53.760 --> 25:54.594
Damn it.

25:55.095 --> 25:55.929
What a waste.

25:57.055 --> 25:58.306
Seriously, what the hell?

25:58.807 --> 25:59.933
Do it properly, damn it.

26:01.434 --> 26:02.561
Do better, all right?

26:56.072 --> 26:58.575
SCHOOL POLICE REPORTING BOX

27:05.999 --> 27:07.292
Hey, so long!

27:07.375 --> 27:09.419
-Be gone!
-Bye-bye!

27:09.502 --> 27:12.088
-Sorry.
-Watch it. The police are here.

27:12.172 --> 27:13.131
Wow.

27:14.299 --> 27:15.300
They're going.

27:15.383 --> 27:17.302
It's all over for Min Ji-ung now.

27:17.385 --> 27:19.721
What happens once they're taken away?

27:19.804 --> 27:21.556
I hope they're forced to move schools.

27:21.640 --> 27:22.724
Seriously, please.

27:22.807 --> 27:26.019
-I hope they're expelled.
-But really, who reported them?

27:26.102 --> 27:28.563
I don't know who it was, but thanks.

27:30.482 --> 27:32.942
HYEONJIN MIDDLE SCHOOL

27:33.026 --> 27:36.613
Heat transfers from hotter objects
to cooler objects.

27:36.696 --> 27:38.156
This happens in three ways.

27:38.239 --> 27:40.617
Let's start with conduction.

27:40.700 --> 27:43.912
We often grill a lot of pork belly
for meals, don't we?

27:43.995 --> 27:46.790
When the meat touches the hot grill,

27:46.873 --> 27:50.877
the particles in contact start moving fast

27:50.960 --> 27:53.588
and pass energy
to other particles in turn.

27:54.464 --> 27:55.882
Hello, sir.

27:57.801 --> 27:58.760
Hurry to your seat.

28:01.471 --> 28:03.223
We'll carry on with the lesson.

28:05.600 --> 28:08.645
You fucking bitch.
You actually snitched to the cops?

28:10.063 --> 28:11.314
That's right, Yun-jin.

28:12.399 --> 28:13.566
They got your letter.

28:14.150 --> 28:16.486
We were investigated thanks to you.

28:16.569 --> 28:19.280
But then, we were let go with a warning.

28:21.116 --> 28:23.118
She must have thought we'd go to prison.

28:23.201 --> 28:24.619
Yeah, as if.

28:24.703 --> 28:25.954
Too bad.

28:26.830 --> 28:30.125
We're juvenile offenders,
so we won't be sent to prison.

28:36.214 --> 28:37.090
Get in there.

28:39.843 --> 28:41.052
Get some rest.

28:45.724 --> 28:48.059
Ji-ung!

28:48.143 --> 28:51.020
Please open the door, Ji-ung.

28:51.730 --> 28:52.731
Ji-ung.

28:53.231 --> 28:54.774
I'm sorry.

28:55.400 --> 28:56.735
Please open the door.

28:57.652 --> 28:58.486
Ji-ung.

28:58.570 --> 29:00.238
If you did something wrong…

29:02.699 --> 29:04.284
you should be punished.

29:05.744 --> 29:06.870
Isn't that right?

29:07.370 --> 29:09.497
Let's take a picture
to remember this moment.

29:14.753 --> 29:17.422
-I'm hungry. Let's go get some food.
-We can't hear you.

29:18.089 --> 29:19.883
-What do you want to eat?
-Pork cutlet.

29:19.966 --> 29:21.342
-Pork cutlet?
-That's crazy.

29:42.113 --> 29:44.699
Can you testify
to everything you just said?

29:50.413 --> 29:52.499
-So we can punish--
-Don't do that.

29:52.582 --> 29:54.334
Is the ERPB any different?

29:54.834 --> 29:58.880
Our homeroom teacher, the school,
and even the police couldn't do anything.

29:58.963 --> 30:00.715
Ji-ung always came looking for me.

30:02.217 --> 30:05.637
Every time I thought
it would be enough or he would stop,

30:06.137 --> 30:08.348
he always came back.

30:10.517 --> 30:12.393
I'm always the only one who gets hurt.

30:13.728 --> 30:16.481
This will only end once I die.

30:34.374 --> 30:36.000
The ERPB is different.

30:37.585 --> 30:41.297
The ERPB is serious
about students who have been hurt.

30:43.049 --> 30:44.342
So trust us.

30:46.636 --> 30:47.971
I will protect you.

30:58.648 --> 30:59.607
Sir.

31:04.863 --> 31:06.114
WRITTEN STATEMENT
GO FUCK YOURSELF

31:06.197 --> 31:09.659
You're gaining points nicely.

31:09.742 --> 31:10.785
Thank you, sir.

31:19.377 --> 31:21.838
It's more than just beating and bullying.

31:21.921 --> 31:23.047
It's drug trafficking.

31:23.923 --> 31:25.216
Those kids I told you about

31:25.300 --> 31:28.469
have been hooked on drugs
and used as runners to make money.

31:33.975 --> 31:35.184
Is this true?

31:37.937 --> 31:39.939
Is that a problem?

31:43.776 --> 31:45.028
Oh, it is.

31:46.070 --> 31:47.071
Now I know.

31:48.823 --> 31:51.367
But as juvenile offenders,

31:51.451 --> 31:55.830
aren't you meant to learn right from wrong
by experiencing different things?

31:55.914 --> 32:00.501
Isn't it the nation's way of giving you
a learning opportunity?

32:03.463 --> 32:07.258
Slyness has its limits,
and you're testing my patience.

32:07.342 --> 32:08.801
Oh, I see.

32:09.302 --> 32:11.387
But I can't stop right away.

32:11.471 --> 32:12.847
I need the money.

32:14.474 --> 32:16.225
I'll stop when I'm no longer underage.

32:17.936 --> 32:20.271
I promise. Really.

32:25.777 --> 32:27.695
Okay, fine.

32:27.779 --> 32:29.572
If you're not happy with this,

32:30.865 --> 32:31.699
just arrest me.

32:31.783 --> 32:33.785
Arrest me and lock me the hell up.

32:37.038 --> 32:38.456
Only if you can.

32:40.541 --> 32:41.584
But you can't, right?

32:41.668 --> 32:43.127
-Annoying, right?
-Fucked, right?

32:43.211 --> 32:45.546
-It's fucked, right?
-It's dog shit, right?

32:52.637 --> 32:54.222
Fuck, don't come near me.

32:54.931 --> 32:55.890
Daddy!

33:02.271 --> 33:03.481
Welcome.

33:03.564 --> 33:05.316
Come here. Good job.

33:05.400 --> 33:07.694
You move back. Go sit at the back.

33:07.777 --> 33:09.529
You think you can fucking run over us?

33:09.612 --> 33:11.656
You're dead
the minute I catch you, bastard!

33:21.833 --> 33:23.167
Welcome, dear passengers.

33:30.383 --> 33:31.300
Stay away!

33:45.732 --> 33:46.566
Han-rim.

33:47.275 --> 33:49.360
-Why are you here?
-It's been a while.

33:52.572 --> 33:53.906
Stay away, damn it!

33:54.407 --> 33:55.491
I'll fucking kill you.

34:04.709 --> 34:07.920
Min Ji-ung, your crimes
have been confirmed as school violence,

34:08.004 --> 34:10.006
dealing designer drugs,

34:10.089 --> 34:11.632
using minors for distribution,

34:11.716 --> 34:14.635
violating educational rights,
and turning the school into hell.

34:14.719 --> 34:16.387
So from now on,

34:17.597 --> 34:18.598
you're screwed.

34:30.610 --> 34:33.362
Where the fuck are we going?

34:33.446 --> 34:36.324
I don't know.
Where the hell are they taking us?

34:45.792 --> 34:46.626
Thank you!

34:49.378 --> 34:50.421
Exit the vehicle.

34:51.130 --> 34:53.174
Seriously, where the fuck are we?

34:53.257 --> 34:54.467
START OVER WITH A DREAM

34:59.388 --> 35:03.726
Welcome to the only juvenile prison
in the Republic of Korea.

35:04.435 --> 35:05.853
A prison, huh?

35:07.355 --> 35:09.398
Did you say
juvenile offenders aren't jailed?

35:09.482 --> 35:11.442
Too bad. We can put you in jail.

35:13.402 --> 35:15.279
Inspector Na, we're good to go.

35:16.364 --> 35:17.532
Let's go.

35:17.615 --> 35:18.908
Someone park the car.

35:21.410 --> 35:22.328
Hello!

35:24.455 --> 35:26.916
GIMCHEON JUVENILE PRISON
IS REQUESTED TO COOPERATE

35:26.999 --> 35:28.251
Minister.

35:30.044 --> 35:32.797
Do you really think this will be okay?

35:33.297 --> 35:34.715
I will take responsibility.

35:38.594 --> 35:42.932
You understand better than anyone
why juvenile offenders are protected.

35:43.558 --> 35:47.228
If this gets out from a place like this,

35:47.311 --> 35:49.981
it will create a stir
about exceeding authority

35:50.064 --> 35:51.440
and violating human rights.

35:51.524 --> 35:54.110
But is that really a reason
to sit back and do nothing?

35:54.610 --> 35:57.238
There needs to be at least one adult
who scolds them,

35:57.738 --> 36:00.283
telling them
that what they've done is wrong.

36:00.366 --> 36:01.993
Please support me in this.

36:03.077 --> 36:04.245
Gosh.

36:04.328 --> 36:05.329
STUDENT RECORD
MIN JI-UNG

36:05.413 --> 36:06.455
-Name?
-Yoon Min-su?

36:06.956 --> 36:07.790
-Min Ji-ung.
-Yes.

36:07.874 --> 36:09.458
Hyundai Seongmo Apartments.

36:09.542 --> 36:11.252
Accessories, earrings, and necklaces.

36:11.335 --> 36:12.712
-Hand them in.
-When can we go?

36:12.795 --> 36:14.547
Put your feet where indicated.

36:14.630 --> 36:16.465
Pull down your underwear. Squat down.

36:16.549 --> 36:17.758
Go back a little.

36:17.842 --> 36:20.428
Pull up your underwear,
take your belongings, and move on.

36:20.511 --> 36:21.637
Step up.

36:23.472 --> 36:24.849
Pull down your underwear.

36:26.851 --> 36:28.436
Pull it down further.

36:29.729 --> 36:30.730
A little more.

36:30.813 --> 36:31.981
Squat down.

36:32.064 --> 36:33.274
Lift your bottom up a bit.

36:37.028 --> 36:38.571
Pull down your underwear.

36:39.488 --> 36:40.323
Damn it.

36:42.325 --> 36:43.409
No.

37:01.469 --> 37:05.181
HOPE-DRIVEN CORRECTION
THAT OPENS DOORS TO BRIGHTER FUTURES

37:11.270 --> 37:12.271
Stand up straight!

37:13.940 --> 37:18.611
You will live under the same conditions
as the other inmates from now on.

37:18.694 --> 37:21.530
You will receive
the same mandatory education,

37:21.614 --> 37:25.660
and you will do volunteer work
in line with ERPB education policy.

37:26.953 --> 37:30.164
Anyone have objections?
They will keep them to themselves.

37:31.290 --> 37:32.458
Move.

37:33.292 --> 37:34.752
-Follow me.
-Move.

37:36.379 --> 37:37.964
We have newbies!

37:45.429 --> 37:47.390
Hey, you motherfucker!

37:49.850 --> 37:51.435
DAILY REFLECTION AS A WAY OF LIFE

38:08.703 --> 38:09.829
We take a dump here?

38:10.830 --> 38:11.914
Damn it.

38:11.998 --> 38:14.166
Inspector Im Han-rim will instruct you

38:14.250 --> 38:16.919
on matters related
to your shared living quarters.

38:17.003 --> 38:19.255
You're really going fucking too far.

38:19.338 --> 38:21.590
I'm going to report this
all over the place.

38:22.174 --> 38:25.636
Mister, lady.
Can you handle the consequences?

38:25.720 --> 38:26.971
You're so noisy.

38:27.054 --> 38:28.848
Just let us out already!

38:29.890 --> 38:31.225
There is

38:31.892 --> 38:32.727
a way out.

38:34.353 --> 38:36.188
I will let you out if you beat me.

38:37.565 --> 38:38.399
What?

38:38.482 --> 38:40.484
Inspector Im Han-rim,
I'll leave it to you.

38:42.445 --> 38:43.654
-Wait.
-Come on.

38:43.738 --> 38:45.489
-Is it okay for us to…
-Let's go.

38:50.077 --> 38:51.871
Inspector.

38:53.122 --> 38:55.249
I know they're just kids,

38:55.333 --> 38:57.084
but it's still four on one.

38:57.168 --> 38:59.045
Aren't you worried?

38:59.128 --> 39:01.213
You're right. I am worried.

39:01.297 --> 39:02.548
About the four.

39:03.090 --> 39:03.924
Yes.

39:06.344 --> 39:07.386
Just fucking do it.

39:12.558 --> 39:14.226
-That gave me a fright.
-Damn you!

39:19.190 --> 39:20.858
That hurts.

39:20.941 --> 39:22.985
When an inmate uses violence,

39:23.069 --> 39:26.322
the use of violence to subdue them
is justified.

39:26.822 --> 39:31.243
This means that I can
justifiably beat the hell out of you guys.

39:42.838 --> 39:44.090
That stings!

39:47.426 --> 39:48.969
It hurts so much.

39:49.470 --> 39:50.429
Damn you!

39:58.521 --> 40:00.689
If you think it's unfair,
come at me anytime.

40:02.691 --> 40:04.235
Please think it's unfair.

40:05.486 --> 40:07.321
And come at me again.

40:11.450 --> 40:13.119
-Wake-up time is 6:30 a.m.
-Wait.

40:13.202 --> 40:15.246
Roll call will last 30 minutes.

40:15.329 --> 40:17.998
Breakfast will commence at 7:00 a.m.

40:18.082 --> 40:22.294
For the next three hours,
your favorite lesson will take place.

40:22.378 --> 40:24.964
At 13:00, you'll exercise
and get a medical checkup.

40:25.047 --> 40:28.509
At 14:00,
special activities will take place.

40:29.510 --> 40:32.888
Computer classes will be held
after physical training and cleaning.

40:32.972 --> 40:34.306
No yawning.

40:34.390 --> 40:35.808
No balancing pens on your lips.

40:37.393 --> 40:38.352
Right.

40:38.436 --> 40:40.229
Inspector Im Han-rim!

40:41.605 --> 40:42.940
Okay, Deputy Bong.

40:43.023 --> 40:44.525
Report to the yard!

40:47.069 --> 40:49.155
Twenty seconds. How many seconds? Go!

40:55.161 --> 40:57.455
What is SSD?

40:57.538 --> 41:00.332
It's a non-volatile memory storage device.

41:02.751 --> 41:04.753
Inspector Im Han-rim!

41:05.254 --> 41:07.715
Report to the yard!

41:10.050 --> 41:12.052
Left!

41:16.891 --> 41:18.184
You have ten seconds left.

41:18.267 --> 41:19.977
-It's because I can't see!
-Time's up!

41:20.060 --> 41:21.979
Four, three,

41:22.062 --> 41:23.939
two, one, zero. Time's up!

41:24.440 --> 41:25.858
You didn't finish.

41:25.941 --> 41:29.445
Report to the yard!

41:32.114 --> 41:33.157
I want to study.

41:38.954 --> 41:41.415
You must pull them all out by today.

41:41.999 --> 41:43.751
Is this the best you've got?

41:45.044 --> 41:46.253
By today? How can we…

41:46.337 --> 41:48.547
-Hurry up. Do it properly.
-I did this much.

41:48.631 --> 41:50.591
What the hell are you doing right now?

41:51.675 --> 41:53.969
Maintain focus and move forward.

41:55.179 --> 41:56.430
It's so hot.

41:56.514 --> 41:58.557
It's seriously too hot.

42:00.226 --> 42:01.143
My hands hurt.

42:03.479 --> 42:05.314
-Hurry up and move.
-Get the fuck out.

42:06.774 --> 42:08.359
What the fuck are you looking at?

42:08.943 --> 42:10.194
Get out, damn it.

42:10.277 --> 42:12.446
Fuck, that's crazy. It's the red patches.

42:13.906 --> 42:15.324
What the fuck is that?

42:15.407 --> 42:18.285
You know, it's for murderers.
There are loads of them.

42:18.369 --> 42:19.537
-Murder?
-Shit.

42:20.037 --> 42:21.539
That's so fucking scary.

42:23.749 --> 42:26.043
What? Is this place not going your way?

42:26.752 --> 42:28.837
Try and see
if being underage works here too.

42:29.838 --> 42:31.173
I'm also curious.

42:32.216 --> 42:33.300
Hold off on serving!

42:33.968 --> 42:37.221
These juvenile offenders
will be served first, starting today.

42:38.681 --> 42:39.765
What the fuck?

42:39.848 --> 42:41.100
-But I don't mind.
-Go on.

42:42.434 --> 42:43.352
Go ahead.

42:43.435 --> 42:44.645
You go first.

42:44.728 --> 42:47.022
Make way for them over there. Go.

42:48.023 --> 42:49.066
Hurry and line up!

42:49.149 --> 42:49.984
-Hurry up!
-Move.

42:50.067 --> 42:51.902
Hurry up, you fucking bastard.

42:51.986 --> 42:52.861
Hurry up!

42:52.945 --> 42:53.946
Fuck you.

42:57.366 --> 42:58.409
You like sausages?

42:58.492 --> 43:01.120
Sure, take a bunch. Here you go.

43:01.203 --> 43:04.039
Our juvenile offenders
need to eat a lot and grow a lot.

43:04.123 --> 43:07.001
A whole string of Vienna sausages.
Eat a whole row of them.

43:08.919 --> 43:10.963
Gosh, we're all out of sausages.

43:11.046 --> 43:12.381
Fucking hell!

43:12.464 --> 43:15.426
Guys, I hope you understand.

43:15.509 --> 43:17.177
They're juvenile offenders.

43:17.261 --> 43:19.805
The rest of you can have what's left.

43:19.888 --> 43:20.973
-Salad.
-You fucker.

43:21.056 --> 43:23.726
Kimchi. Dried radish. Soup.

43:24.727 --> 43:27.563
-Have some watermelon.
-I said eat up!

43:27.646 --> 43:29.231
-Hey, eat up.
-Eat up!

43:32.610 --> 43:33.527
Fucking hell.

43:35.404 --> 43:36.322
You going to do it?

43:37.698 --> 43:38.991
You do it all, dumbass.

43:39.074 --> 43:41.076
Seriously, why do we have to do this shit?

43:41.160 --> 43:42.620
-Damn it.
-Seriously. Fuck.

43:48.834 --> 43:50.210
These are the dirty dishes.

43:52.463 --> 43:55.716
The prison guard said
there's a lot of grease on them.

43:55.799 --> 43:58.969
So I'd like you to take extra care
when washing them.

43:59.053 --> 44:00.929
But these need to be washed quickly.

44:01.930 --> 44:04.266
The rice often sticks to the dishes.

44:04.350 --> 44:08.187
You've got to clean them thoroughly.
Scraping them works well.

44:08.270 --> 44:09.772
Hurry and get started.

44:12.191 --> 44:14.109
How much longer do we have to stay here?

44:14.193 --> 44:15.861
Quit bawling. You're not a kid.

44:15.944 --> 44:17.488
Does my dad know or not?

44:17.571 --> 44:19.198
Fuck, why haven't I heard from him?

44:19.281 --> 44:20.616
You'd have heard if he knew.

44:20.699 --> 44:22.493
I can't believe Mom and Dad don't know.

44:22.576 --> 44:25.079
And you can believe
they've locked up juveniles?

44:25.996 --> 44:28.499
These bastards would be all fucked
if my dad found out.

44:28.582 --> 44:31.210
That jerk seems like a dumbass too.

44:31.293 --> 44:32.127
Let's tell them.

44:34.546 --> 44:35.756
Let our parents know

44:36.799 --> 44:37.675
we're here.

44:37.758 --> 44:38.926
Well, how?

44:39.426 --> 44:40.969
There must be a fucking way.

44:42.096 --> 44:43.722
They'll only keep piling up.

44:46.183 --> 44:47.059
-Gross.
-Oh my.

44:47.851 --> 44:50.688
-Sorry.
-For fuck's sake!

44:51.188 --> 44:53.899
I'm already pissed off,
you fucking asshole.

44:53.982 --> 44:56.068
Right, guys.

44:56.151 --> 44:57.861
I'm probably much older than you.

44:57.945 --> 44:59.363
So? You want respect from us?

45:00.114 --> 45:01.490
I don't want to give you any.

45:01.573 --> 45:02.741
Hey, he's scared.

45:03.575 --> 45:04.493
So what?

45:04.576 --> 45:06.078
What are you going to fucking do?

45:06.662 --> 45:07.496
Ji-ung.

45:07.579 --> 45:08.539
Hey!

45:08.622 --> 45:09.832
Ji-ung!

45:12.835 --> 45:13.711
Get out!

45:18.298 --> 45:20.217
Fuck you!

45:20.843 --> 45:22.553
Hey, get off each other!

45:23.053 --> 45:24.388
Get out!

45:30.310 --> 45:31.145
What happened?

45:32.020 --> 45:34.440
-What's going on?
-I fell over, sir.

45:36.942 --> 45:38.318
Wasn't Min Ji-ung beating you?

45:38.402 --> 45:39.236
No, sir.

45:39.737 --> 45:41.989
He was actually helping me up.

45:42.072 --> 45:43.782
-No, this asshole--
-Thanks.

45:45.784 --> 45:47.119
I'll return the favor.

45:55.294 --> 45:56.295
No, but…

46:03.051 --> 46:03.927
Min Ji-ung.

46:06.096 --> 46:07.973
That inmate foreman earlier…

46:08.640 --> 46:10.058
You didn't hit him, did you?

46:12.603 --> 46:16.148
Mess with anyone else,
but whatever you do, don't mess with him.

46:16.231 --> 46:17.816
What if I do?

46:19.985 --> 46:21.862
You'll be in serious trouble.

46:22.821 --> 46:25.115
Do you know what kind of person
Kim Su-gyeom is?

46:26.492 --> 46:28.368
He used to be bullied at school.

46:29.369 --> 46:31.830
But he ended up killing the bullies.

46:31.914 --> 46:33.916
Every last one of them.

46:36.460 --> 46:38.045
Get lost, you fucking bastard!

46:39.254 --> 46:40.839
Get lost. I said get lost!

46:40.923 --> 46:42.800
What the fuck? That crazy bastard!

47:06.865 --> 47:08.867
I remember now. It was all over the news.

47:08.951 --> 47:11.119
The bully killer. That's right.

47:12.412 --> 47:15.958
If not, that's fine.
Be sure to stay out of his way.

47:39.815 --> 47:41.024
Damn you.

48:43.420 --> 48:44.254
Not here.

48:44.338 --> 48:45.505
Not here.

48:46.173 --> 48:47.132
Not here.

48:47.215 --> 48:48.342
Not here!

48:48.842 --> 48:51.511
A spoon is missing.
We're conducting a body search.

48:51.595 --> 48:54.598
There have been cases
where spoons have been made into weapons

48:54.681 --> 48:56.224
or used for self-harm.

48:56.308 --> 48:58.310
So this is intended as a safety measure.

48:58.393 --> 48:59.436
Start the search.

49:10.906 --> 49:13.367
-It's that bastard!
-Hands on your head!

49:13.992 --> 49:16.119
I saw a spoon in that bastard's pocket.

49:16.203 --> 49:17.871
I'm sure it's a spoon.

49:20.749 --> 49:21.583
Step aside.

49:22.918 --> 49:24.711
Turn around. Hands on your head.

49:27.923 --> 49:28.924
On the left side.

49:42.854 --> 49:44.022
Why would you have…

49:46.733 --> 49:49.319
Trainee, think before you speak
from now on.

49:49.403 --> 49:50.237
Understood?

49:51.029 --> 49:52.739
-Carry on.
-Back to positions.

49:52.823 --> 49:53.657
Turn around.

49:53.740 --> 49:56.576
-Stand against the wall.
-Face forward. Raise your arms.

49:57.160 --> 49:58.412
-Hands on head.
-Eyes ahead.

49:58.495 --> 50:00.080
Stand against the wall.

50:00.580 --> 50:01.665
What are you doing?

50:01.748 --> 50:03.000
Hands on your head.

50:13.719 --> 50:14.928
Out of the way!

50:20.392 --> 50:23.020
I'm already here
serving the maximum possible sentence,

50:23.103 --> 50:25.105
so killing you won't change a thing.

50:25.188 --> 50:26.565
Inmate 1397, get off him!

50:29.067 --> 50:30.694
Get inside!

50:30.777 --> 50:32.738
From now on, this place is hell,

50:32.821 --> 50:34.322
and I'll make sure to find you.

50:34.406 --> 50:36.867
Let's play hide and seek all day long.

50:36.950 --> 50:38.076
Stay still!

50:38.618 --> 50:40.495
There are lots like me here.

50:42.998 --> 50:45.000
Right, guys?

50:45.083 --> 50:47.044
Right? Aren't I right?

50:47.127 --> 50:48.253
Right?

51:05.896 --> 51:07.397
MINISTRY OF EDUCATION

51:07.481 --> 51:09.191
The worst human rights violators!

51:09.274 --> 51:11.151
The ERPB must apologize!

51:11.234 --> 51:13.361
Apologize!

51:13.445 --> 51:15.030
The worst human rights violators!

51:15.113 --> 51:16.073
Hey, he's here!

51:16.156 --> 51:18.158
Minister!

51:19.159 --> 51:21.286
Just a moment, Minister!

51:21.912 --> 51:25.123
Minister!

51:25.207 --> 51:27.125
-Minister.
-Just stop for a moment!

51:27.209 --> 51:29.044
-Minister!
-Hey!

51:29.544 --> 51:30.837
I said stop!

51:31.338 --> 51:32.297
Hold on, Minister!

51:32.380 --> 51:33.423
-Minister!
-Sir!

51:33.507 --> 51:35.383
-Wait a moment!
-Sir!

51:35.467 --> 51:37.135
-Minister!
-Get out of the way!

51:37.219 --> 51:38.053
Just a moment.

51:38.136 --> 51:39.471
Minister, just a moment.

51:39.554 --> 51:42.432
Is it true
that you sent our children to prison?

51:43.350 --> 51:44.768
Yes, that's right.

51:44.851 --> 51:47.354
How could you send
those young children to prison?

51:47.437 --> 51:49.397
It's a field trip.

51:49.981 --> 51:51.483
They'll end up there eventually.

51:51.566 --> 51:52.484
-What?
-Ridiculous.

51:52.567 --> 51:54.152
-Are you kidding me?
-What nonsense.

51:54.236 --> 51:57.114
How could you?
You didn't even get our permission!

51:57.197 --> 51:59.699
Would you have allowed it if we had asked?

51:59.783 --> 52:01.701
-What?
-You should've at least let us know!

52:02.285 --> 52:04.121
I seriously can't believe this guy.

52:04.704 --> 52:06.248
This is driving me nuts.

52:06.331 --> 52:07.833
Great detail there.

52:08.708 --> 52:10.127
Why didn't you write in detail

52:10.210 --> 52:12.629
what your kids did
and where they were taken

52:12.712 --> 52:14.256
on those protest signs?

52:14.339 --> 52:15.423
-Excuse me?
-Seriously?

52:15.507 --> 52:16.675
I can't believe this.

52:16.758 --> 52:19.386
Goodness, where do you get the nerve?

52:19.469 --> 52:20.637
Excuse me, mister.

52:20.720 --> 52:24.474
I'll do whatever it takes to drag you down
from there, so be ready for it.

52:24.558 --> 52:27.936
Being a minister isn't all that
in this day and age.

52:28.019 --> 52:29.771
Forget it. Don't bother.

52:29.855 --> 52:33.275
Ji-ung's mom, let's go to the press
and bring this to the National Assembly.

52:33.358 --> 52:34.734
-That's perfect.
-Sounds great.

52:34.818 --> 52:35.902
-Let's go!
-Let's go!

52:35.986 --> 52:38.572
No need for that.
Come to the children's school tomorrow.

52:38.655 --> 52:41.533
Why? Do we have to come
just because you tell us to?

52:41.616 --> 52:44.244
It will be the last chance
to see your children.

52:44.744 --> 52:45.996
So do as you please.

52:46.079 --> 52:47.539
-What did you say?
-What?

52:47.622 --> 52:49.624
-What do you mean?
-What last chance?

52:49.708 --> 52:51.418
-What last chance?
-Wait, come back!

52:51.501 --> 52:52.419
Minister!

53:12.230 --> 53:13.315
Go inside.

53:13.398 --> 53:14.816
-Mom.
-It's Dad. Dad!

53:15.400 --> 53:16.776
-Dad!
-Ji-ung.

53:19.321 --> 53:20.447
Yes, darling.

53:20.530 --> 53:22.240
My goodness, darling.

53:28.955 --> 53:31.374
I'm so upset.
What on earth are you wearing?

53:31.458 --> 53:32.500
Are you crazy?

53:33.251 --> 53:34.669
Excuse me.

53:35.295 --> 53:37.923
Why are our children in this state?

53:38.006 --> 53:41.218
I looked into it a bit,
and you did all sorts of nonsense.

53:41.301 --> 53:43.511
You got them to do the dishes?
Even I don't!

53:43.595 --> 53:47.224
Also, I heard you put them
in the same space as murderers!

53:47.307 --> 53:49.226
As a human, how could you do that?

53:49.309 --> 53:54.105
How could you send children
as young as 14 years old to prison?

53:54.189 --> 53:55.982
Don't you know they're underage?

53:57.108 --> 53:58.109
Now.

54:00.195 --> 54:02.072
Do you know what this is?

54:02.822 --> 54:04.115
What is it?

54:06.243 --> 54:07.410
Tell them. What is it?

54:10.497 --> 54:13.541
They're just diet pills.

54:13.625 --> 54:16.294
The kids asked me
to get them for them, so I did.

54:16.378 --> 54:17.587
What's the problem?

54:26.638 --> 54:27.472
Oh my God.

54:28.056 --> 54:29.808
What are you doing? You must be crazy.

54:29.891 --> 54:31.309
Oh my goodness!

54:32.227 --> 54:34.396
What's the matter?

54:34.479 --> 54:35.814
I swallowed it.

54:35.897 --> 54:37.440
For God's sake.

54:37.524 --> 54:38.858
-Mom! What do I do?
-Oh my!

54:39.484 --> 54:41.861
Why? What's wrong? What?

54:41.945 --> 54:44.572
You said they're diet pills.
Don't you want to lose weight?

54:45.156 --> 54:46.324
What's wrong? Jesus!

54:48.576 --> 54:49.995
Mom, what do I do?

54:50.078 --> 54:52.205
-Mom!
-They're just supplements.

54:52.289 --> 54:53.456
That's enough.

54:55.625 --> 54:56.668
They're supplements?

54:57.252 --> 54:59.212
Shit, I'm fucked.

54:59.296 --> 55:01.339
You seem aware
these pills shouldn't be taken.

55:01.423 --> 55:04.092
-Mom, I nearly got fucked.
-Why? What's wrong?

55:04.175 --> 55:06.845
These pills,
the same shape as the ones he just took,

55:06.928 --> 55:09.431
are designer drugs containing phentermine.

55:11.599 --> 55:13.852
They were feeding them to their friends.

55:16.771 --> 55:19.149
Mom, I really didn't know.

55:19.232 --> 55:20.692
I didn't know what I was doing.

55:21.276 --> 55:22.110
Mom.

55:22.193 --> 55:23.445
He says he didn't know!

55:24.362 --> 55:26.364
They're juvenile offenders for a reason.

55:26.448 --> 55:30.994
Children have no idea
what consequences these things can have.

55:31.077 --> 55:35.665
That's why adults should protect
juvenile offenders.

55:35.749 --> 55:38.418
-Isn't that right? Aren't I right?
-What do kids know?

55:38.501 --> 55:39.878
-They're young.
-Deputy Bong.

55:41.004 --> 55:42.380
Please look here.

55:42.922 --> 55:47.385
This is evidence that they distributed
and sold these drugs to their friends.

55:48.470 --> 55:51.598
They have made
over 50 million won this way.

55:52.140 --> 55:53.141
It's huge, isn't it?

55:53.224 --> 55:54.309
MIN JI-UNG
56,131,893 WON

55:55.727 --> 55:58.605
Juvenile offenders
who should be protected?

55:59.356 --> 56:00.565
Sure.

56:00.648 --> 56:01.900
EVIDENCE OF ASSAULT BY MIN JI-UNG

56:01.983 --> 56:03.485
Then what about the victims here?

56:05.570 --> 56:06.696
Who will protect them?

56:08.782 --> 56:10.909
But they didn't know.

56:11.409 --> 56:14.913
It's not too late to teach them now.
Isn't that right, sir?

56:14.996 --> 56:17.457
-Let's pool money for the settlement.
-Yes, let's.

56:17.540 --> 56:19.501
We'll use it to compensate the victims.

56:20.001 --> 56:23.380
Then we just need to get the petitions
and submit them, don't we?

56:23.880 --> 56:24.881
That's right.

56:24.964 --> 56:26.466
We'll do everything necessary.

56:26.549 --> 56:29.135
-So please go easy on them, sir.
-Just this once…

56:29.219 --> 56:32.472
They're still young children
with their whole lives ahead of them.

56:32.555 --> 56:35.058
Shouldn't they be given a chance, sir?

56:35.141 --> 56:36.351
Shut up!

56:39.771 --> 56:42.023
"You must not harm others."

56:43.274 --> 56:45.402
"You must not hurt others."

56:47.570 --> 56:50.198
These are the things
you should have taught them.

56:52.575 --> 56:54.411
If you couldn't, the school should have.

56:56.329 --> 56:59.791
If the school couldn't,
society should have taught them.

57:01.418 --> 57:03.753
But everyone failed,
so the ERPB had to step in.

57:04.254 --> 57:06.297
At least the ERPB will teach them.

57:07.507 --> 57:09.884
When a person does wrong,
they will be punished!

57:10.385 --> 57:13.680
Perpetrators should never stand taller
than their victims!

57:19.769 --> 57:21.771
That's how they must take responsibility.

57:33.158 --> 57:34.993
Mom, do something.

57:35.785 --> 57:37.036
-Mom?
-Just a moment.

57:37.871 --> 57:41.583
He says he is truly repentant, sir.
I mean, Minister.

57:41.666 --> 57:42.542
I'm sorry.

57:43.126 --> 57:44.961
You won't ever do that again, will you?

57:45.044 --> 57:45.879
-No.
-No.

57:45.962 --> 57:47.881
I'm sorry! I'm really sorry!

57:47.964 --> 57:51.426
I won't ever do it again.
I have truly repented, sir.

57:51.509 --> 57:53.052
Please let me off this once.

57:53.136 --> 57:54.804
Please give me another chance.

57:54.888 --> 57:56.514
Please, I beg you.

57:57.098 --> 57:58.057
I really…

57:58.558 --> 58:01.269
-Please.
-Right, you should've repented like this.

58:01.352 --> 58:04.105
I really can't go back. I can't.

58:04.606 --> 58:06.691
But we're not the ones

58:08.276 --> 58:09.277
to forgive you.

58:52.987 --> 58:53.905
You guys…

58:56.866 --> 58:58.743
I will never forgive you.

59:02.539 --> 59:05.708
I never had a single day of peace,
all because of you.

59:07.293 --> 59:10.755
I was so terrified
that I couldn't even breathe.

59:12.507 --> 59:13.675
To me,

59:15.593 --> 59:16.761
school was hell.

59:19.931 --> 59:22.976
From now on, this place is hell,
and I'll make sure to find you.

59:23.059 --> 59:25.979
Let's play hide and seek all day long.

59:27.855 --> 59:30.567
Why should I run away
when you're the ones who did wrong?

59:31.484 --> 59:33.278
I want to go to school too!

59:33.778 --> 59:35.780
I want to graduate too!

59:35.863 --> 59:37.740
What the hell is she saying?

59:38.658 --> 59:39.909
I'm a juvenile offender.

59:40.618 --> 59:43.204
It means I'm allowed to kill you,
fucking bitch!

59:43.288 --> 59:45.206
Ji-ung! Oh my God!

59:52.964 --> 59:56.467
The parents' request
for the release of the children

59:57.760 --> 59:59.512
is hereby denied.

59:59.596 --> 01:00:00.722
No, wait…

01:00:00.805 --> 01:00:02.724
-Hereby denied?
-What do you mean, denied?

01:00:02.807 --> 01:00:03.975
What do you mean?

01:00:04.058 --> 01:00:07.061
The children will be taken back
to the juvenile prison.

01:00:07.145 --> 01:00:08.730
-No.
-What do you mean? No.

01:00:08.813 --> 01:00:09.897
-Mister!
-Dad!

01:00:09.981 --> 01:00:11.274
No!

01:00:14.902 --> 01:00:15.945
Mom! What do I do?

01:00:17.155 --> 01:00:18.406
Mom!

01:00:18.489 --> 01:00:19.991
Oh no, my baby!

01:00:21.451 --> 01:00:22.285
Ji-ung!

01:00:25.997 --> 01:00:28.291
My baby! Move aside for a second!

01:01:13.878 --> 01:01:15.755
Thank you.

01:01:17.423 --> 01:01:21.844
From now on, the ERPB
will educate juvenile offenders.

01:01:22.637 --> 01:01:26.599
Seventy years have passed,
yet there has only been empty talk.

01:01:27.266 --> 01:01:30.395
The juvenile system hasn't changed,
but crimes have increased.

01:01:30.478 --> 01:01:33.981
As a result, innocent students
are still suffering today.

01:01:34.065 --> 01:01:37.819
Since someone has to make changes,
the ERPB will step up.

01:01:38.820 --> 01:01:40.780
The law may exempt juvenile offenders,

01:01:41.280 --> 01:01:44.409
but the education system will not.

01:01:47.954 --> 01:01:50.415
Hey, babe!

01:02:07.348 --> 01:02:08.558
Fuck.

01:02:13.312 --> 01:02:14.147
Get inside.

01:02:16.274 --> 01:02:18.317
If you did wrong, you should be punished.

01:02:32.623 --> 01:02:33.708
I'm sorry.

01:02:56.814 --> 01:02:57.648
Get inside.

01:03:01.527 --> 01:03:03.696
Feel the victims' pain.

01:03:04.280 --> 01:03:06.073
You'll learn a lot in there.

01:03:14.999 --> 01:03:15.958
Get inside.

01:03:16.626 --> 01:03:17.585
Get inside.

01:03:21.798 --> 01:03:23.758
How long do we have to stay here?

01:03:24.509 --> 01:03:25.802
Until you're of age.

01:03:26.844 --> 01:03:28.179
After that,

01:03:28.262 --> 01:03:30.598
the law will hold you accountable anyway.

01:03:38.940 --> 01:03:41.150
Yun-jin, I'm sorry.

01:03:41.234 --> 01:03:42.902
Yun-jin!

01:03:42.985 --> 01:03:44.570
I'm sorry. I'll never do it again.

01:03:44.654 --> 01:03:46.697
Please open the door, Yun-jin.

01:03:47.824 --> 01:03:48.866
Yun-jin.

01:03:59.335 --> 01:04:00.169
Good work, guys.

01:04:00.253 --> 01:04:01.963
-Thank you.
-Thank you.

01:04:02.046 --> 01:04:03.089
Thank you.

01:04:09.762 --> 01:04:11.722
Are you sure this is enough?

01:04:11.806 --> 01:04:13.015
Yes, sir.

01:04:15.017 --> 01:04:16.435
I really missed this.

01:04:17.478 --> 01:04:18.312
All right.

01:04:20.356 --> 01:04:21.524
Thanks for helping me.

01:04:22.108 --> 01:04:24.819
Not at all.
I offered to help in the first place.

01:04:26.737 --> 01:04:27.905
But in return,

01:04:28.781 --> 01:04:30.408
please promise me one thing.

01:04:33.119 --> 01:04:35.371
Please make sure
no one ends up like me again.

01:04:37.540 --> 01:04:39.750
I think the ERPB
will be able to manage that.

01:04:46.090 --> 01:04:47.675
Can I really drink this?

01:05:01.731 --> 01:05:02.982
Hey, juvenile offender.

01:05:06.193 --> 01:05:07.028
Yes?

01:05:07.695 --> 01:05:09.280
You know the BS gang boss, right?

01:05:11.490 --> 01:05:13.159
But I didn't mention that thing.

01:05:13.242 --> 01:05:15.036
-Not a single word.
-Well done.

01:05:15.828 --> 01:05:18.289
But our boss tends to be quite cautious.

01:05:18.372 --> 01:05:20.333
-Do you know what I mean?
-Yes.

01:05:22.043 --> 01:05:23.127
Goodbye.

01:07:01.142 --> 01:07:04.103
Subtitle translation by: Lisa Kim
